{
    "artifact":  "codex-amendment-request",
    "authority":  "request-only",
    "schema":  "codex-amendment-request/v2",
    "request_id":  "machine-schema-parity-restamp-seal-canonical-v1-20261002",
    "title":  "Machine-schema parity closure: restamp canonical_semantic_hash to SEAL_CANONICAL_V1 producer hash for all 77 registry rows",
    "summary":  "Governor worklist item 13 (2026-10-02): adopt SEAL_CANONICAL_V1 as the canonical machine-schema semantic-hash recipe - the option-B path of the 2026-09-24 staged proposal. The C#-ported toolchain (--schema-parity probe) measures producer_semantic_hash == validator_semantic_hash for all 77 rows (77/77 PASS) while 0/77 stored canonical_semantic_hash values match: the legacy canonical stamps were produced by a descriptor projection that is no longer derivable. This request restamps machine_schema_parity_evidence (canonical/producer/validator/persistence_semantic_hash -\u003e measured hash, status -\u003e PASS, validated_against_version, reason) and machine_schema_registry.parity_status -\u003e PASS for all 77 rows. Parity output remains evidence; the registry stamp converges to the measured recipe.",
    "requested_by":  "decision-sovereign",
    "origin":  "governor worklist decision 2026-10-02 (AGENTS item 13): adopt SEAL_CANONICAL_V1; staged proposal codex-amendment-proposal-machine-schema-parity-restamp-20260924 option B authorized for the current 77-row registry",
    "problem":  {
                    "summary":  "machine_schema_parity_evidence.canonical_semantic_hash carries legacy stamps under a non-derivable descriptor projection; the governed SEAL_CANONICAL_V1 recipe measures a different (correct) descriptor hash, so 77/77 rows sit at parity_status=PENDING / persistence_layer=CANONICAL_MISMATCH despite the schema rows being semantically correct.",
                    "affected":  [
                                     "machine_schema_parity_evidence",
                                     "machine_schema_registry"
                                 ],
                    "scope":  "parity evidence + registry parity flag restamp only; no schema content change, no runtime behavior change"
                },
    "change_class":  "provision-scope",
    "required_review":  "five-sovereign-audit-unanimous-pass",
    "flow":  "A382/A488-non-disruptive-amendment-flow",
    "not_executed":  true,
    "predecessor":  {
